<v UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE>You don't want to put . . .

1724
01:55:36.978 --> 01:55:40.711
<v DELMA BENNETT>I decided that it was time for me to find a wife.

1725
01:55:40.711 --> 01:55:43.511
So I prayed and asked God for a wife.

1726
01:55:43.511 --> 01:55:46.000
<v CHRISTINE BENNETT>You put it that's what I’m saying.

1727
01:55:46.000 --> 01:55:47.148
<v DELMA BENNETT>I'd been praying.

1728
01:55:47.148 --> 01:55:52.123
So I went to the beach where I met her at the beach.

1729
01:55:52.123 --> 01:55:54.420
I saw this little girl pretty.

1730
01:55:54.420 --> 01:55:59.395
I mean just as pretty as she wanted to be, but she was

1731
01:55:59.395 --> 01:56:01.309
<c.p>much younger than I was.

1732
01:56:01.309 --> 01:56:03.988
And she was still in high school.

1733
01:56:03.988 --> 01:56:08.963
I'd been in college and I'd been in the army and all this.

1734
01:56:08.963 --> 01:56:12.025
I was nine years older than she was.

1735
01:56:12.025 --> 01:56:20.827
So I walked up to her and I was talking to her and I was . . . Didn't say nothing out of place or anything.

1736
01:56:20.827 --> 01:56:25.420
So after I finished talking to her I went to the water,

1737
01:56:25.420 --> 01:56:31.160
the beach that they be talking about, and the sun was setting at the time.

1738
01:56:31.160 --> 01:56:33.457
Looked like the water start sparkling.

1739
01:56:33.457 --> 01:56:35.753
I mean it just start sparkling.

1740
01:56:35.753 --> 01:56:37.667
I said, "You know what?

1741
01:56:37.667 --> 01:56:39.198
God what this mean?"

1742
01:56:39.198 --> 01:56:45.321
I mean I was into the Lord, but I wasn't serving him like I do now.

1743
01:56:45.321 --> 01:56:47.617
I said, "Lord what this mean?"

1744
01:56:47.617 --> 01:56:53.741
So I went up to her and I say, "Girl, you going to be my wife."

1745
01:56:53.741 --> 01:56:54.506
She laughed.

1746
01:56:54.506 --> 01:56:56.802
I say, "What's your phone number?”

1747
01:56:56.802 --> 01:56:59.864
She said, "My phone number is [Harden Delafosse?]."

1748
01:56:59.864 --> 01:57:01.012
That's her daddy.

1749
01:57:01.012 --> 01:57:02.926
I'm supposed to get scared.

1750
01:57:02.926 --> 01:57:05.222
Her phone number is Harden Delafosse.

1751
01:57:05.222 --> 01:57:10.963
So I looked for Harden Delafosse in the phone book and I seen some Delafosses,

1752
01:57:10.963 --> 01:57:18.617
but they spell the name with two L's and the Delafosse that I saw only had one L in it.

1753
01:57:18.617 --> 01:57:22.062
So I couldn’t find Harden Delafosse nowhere in it.

1754
01:57:22.062 --> 01:57:30.481
So I met this girl that lived across the street from her and I said, "You know a man named Harden Delafosse?"

1755
01:57:30.481 --> 01:57:31.630
He say, "Yeah."

1756
01:57:31.630 --> 01:57:37.370
I said, "I been looking for it in the phone book and couldn't find it."

1757
01:57:37.370 --> 01:57:47.321
He said, "Well maybe you didn't look under the right Delafosse because one is with two L's and one is with one L." So he said,

1758
01:57:47.321 --> 01:57:50.000
"I think his is two L's."

1759
01:57:50.000 --> 01:57:53.044
So I found it and I called her.

1760
01:57:53.044 --> 01:57:59.512
We talked a whole year on the telephone before I even got a chance to see her.

1761
01:57:59.512 --> 01:58:01.795
A whole year on the telephone.

1762
01:58:01.795 --> 01:58:06.361
I had opened me a place of business over on Enterprise Boulevard.

1763
01:58:06.361 --> 01:58:11.688
One of the worst spots that you could have opened . . . According to her family,

1764
01:58:11.688 --> 01:58:17.395
one of the worst spots you could have opened a business at on Enterprise Boulevard.

1765
01:58:17.395 --> 01:58:24.244
I had me a little African American gift shop where I made African American jewelry out of bamboo.

1766
01:58:24.244 --> 01:58:29.951
And I printed signs because I went to school for commercial arts in San Francisco.

1767
01:58:29.951 --> 01:58:36.420
So I was printing signs that . . . And I would go to different businesses and stuff and if

1768
01:58:36.420 --> 01:58:47.454
<c.p>I see an old sign on a wall I would go home and make another one and it would look completely different from what they had on the wall.

1769
01:58:47.454 --> 01:58:50.878
They would like it, and I would sell it.

1770
01:58:50.878 --> 01:58:56.585
So I started taking care of myself off of the jewelry and the sign printing.

1771
01:58:56.585 --> 01:59:00.010
Then we got together and eventually we got married.

1772
01:59:00.010 --> 01:59:05.337
Boy her daddy, that was the worst thing could have happened to her daddy.

1773
01:59:05.337 --> 01:59:06.098
I'm serious.

1774
01:59:06.098 --> 01:59:08.000
<v ARSENEAULT>What did he say?

1775
01:59:08.000 --> 01:59:14.584
<v DELMA BENNETT>I asked him to marry her and he say, "Well boy, go talk to my wife."

1776
01:59:14.584 --> 01:59:21.991
So I went to talk to his wife and stuff and she gave us permission to get married.

1777
01:59:21.991 --> 01:59:27.341
We got married and we're getting ready to have the wedding and stuff.

1778
01:59:27.341 --> 01:59:29.398
He say, "Come here boy."

1779
01:59:29.398 --> 01:59:35.571
And I went up to the door and he gave me twenty dollar bill. [laughs]

1780
01:59:35.571 --> 01:59:37.217
<v ARSENEAULT>That was his blessing.

1781
01:59:37.217 --> 01:59:37.628
<v DELMA BENNETT>Yeah.

1782
01:59:37.628 --> 01:59:40.097
Gave me a twenty dollar bill.

1783
01:59:40.097 --> 01:59:49.973
So I went on and got everything arranged and we had some African American outfit that we had made for our wedding and stuff.

1784
01:59:49.973 --> 01:59:52.442
We been together now forty-three years.

1785
01:59:52.442 --> 01:59:52.854
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1786
01:59:52.854 --> 01:59:54.088
<v DELMA BENNETT>Yeah, forty-three years.

1787
01:59:54.088 --> 01:59:56.146
It ain't been easy neither.

1788
