No, she say I'm the worst thing ever happened to her. [laughs] Don't laugh man.

1789
02:00:02.319 --> 02:00:05.199
She say I'm the worst thing ever

1790
02:00:05.199 --> 02:00:07.668
<c.p>happened to her in her life.

1791
02:00:07.668 --> 02:00:08.080
Yeah.

1792
02:00:08.080 --> 02:00:10.137
<v ARSENEAULT>I'm sure that's not true.

1793
02:00:10.137 --> 02:00:11.372
<v DELMA BENNETT>I don't know.

1794
02:00:11.372 --> 02:00:13.018
That's what she say.

1795
02:00:13.018 --> 02:00:16.310
But again, I like talking about the plants.

1796
02:00:16.310 --> 02:00:23.305
Half of the people that work at the plants aren't aware of the dangers that they're in.

1797
02:00:23.305 --> 02:00:28.243
Half of them are not aware of the danger that they’re in.

1798
